  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BioDAF II Black soldier fly larvae as a source of sustainable agricultural inputs for urban food</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address urban waste management and improve food security in C te d?Ivoire by leveraging the bioconversion capabilities of Black Soldier Fly larvae. Through a decentralized model, the project will transform urban bio-waste into protein-rich animal feed and organic fertilizer, empowering farmers to produce their own sustainable agricultural inputs.</narrative>
  </description>
